cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the manuscript below. Please also cite
  MMDetection and the upstream backbone projects listed in THIRD_PARTY.md --
  this repository is a fork of MMDetection and the backbone architectures
  are the work of their respective authors.
title: >-
  Date-palm instance segmentation across sensors and scales: CNN,
  transformer and state-space backbones
authors:
  - family-names: Gibril
    given-names: Mohamed Barakat A.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/brakuta/Datepalm-Instance-Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Mask R-CNN with eleven interchangeable backbones evaluated on date-palm
  crown instance segmentation from 5 cm UAV to 30 cm satellite imagery,
  with the hard-negative adaptation used for a country-scale inventory.
keywords:
  - instance segmentation
  - remote sensing
  - state space models
  - date palm
  - very high resolution imagery

